gress over time and highlights areas needing more focus. (Optional enhancement)",\n      "isEnabled": false\n    }\n  ],\n  "techStack": {\n    "frontend": [\n      "Vite"\n    ],\n    "backend": [\n      "None"\n    ],\n    "language": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#1A73E8",\n    "secondary": "#F1F3F4",\n    "accent": "#FFB300"\n  },\n  "theme": "light",\n  "layoutDescription": "The UI should feature a modern, clean dashboard with a prominent search or selection bar for roles and topics. The main area displays adaptive questions and answers, with options to pin, mark as learned, or explore further. A sidebar or top menu provides access to session history, progress tracking, and quick-revision lists. Colors and typography should evoke a sense of intelligence, trust, and focus."\n}'}",
